    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d210">

                <pb facs="0305" n="189" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg189"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.13/31.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gonzales to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 27, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The President vetoed amnesty for General Asbert.</p>
                <p>There are threats of revolution by Asbertistas if Congress fails next month to
                    pass Amnesty Bill over veto. Distress of great numbers of unemployed encourages
                    movement. I have some concern for the President’s personal safety.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
